  "body": "This PR replaces [a previous PR](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7424) by re-working that section holistically in an attempt to be more readable, since this is complex.\n\nWe also created [A hopefully helpful chart](https://mermaid.ink/svg/pako:eNqdVlFv4jgQ_itW-nCtFFApFEqk3ioUkHbVU6S2-3LHPZjEaawmNrJNKUv47zfjGEhK95ZtH1o7_mbmm5lvXG-8WCbMC7w0l6s4o8qQp_FMEPi524wl04QbktFXRihJuCLUGMXnS8O2pNX6s4RPt7lRJRn_89UQrgls_nXme4AyeUkmDgCbIwBdGlmS6earjTbDYyoIF4ulISxnBROGrDKpGTHrBTtwQH-INuzN-EQzquLMh13OFpkUzCdLlftEKsIKynMLjR7sH4hkMrZ3Dn6o9UIVo7uvX7Z1nkKiIy5eac4TLEVJoopwu90GZIWNLLZijlxvgUwZhef74lzUcTqXxrCkjEYOgJzANYsNlwICmTWRKYQAelrzZ8ESgjYNJ5TEGc8TBFIioJlVSTLq0tIZTeSKKClNvQLUenpXXgt6b1VGd_9LD70hRcT-oQk42ruFbRPffkfdcqjFtr40pGF-ztwKEjkuoFvikEIZjS1PkTGFfFIlC0uswjUji7XJuHgGY83KaHLUoOr31ILXMAUl-bYbB03aIIJlVWdtcGRW3GRkzmu52kOcJxobpirdhvcooYcvZNv0D9IqSRie3zND5uTWllkxvcwNljeX8gWZUlcdLGoshYGUIEdwuAPguuosMmnRV9A8necwL7jCha02oLRREgwO9FzSYWj5zJHOCMU9r7Rtz0auZc00P07xA6GtMh5nrnHHGoJbAYPuhAbbnVJOi3tfj3haSOg1hhwftd5FRA2mcimSMpycP32o_HdXCG41LaDgIJPGaTUHxxcXxuBYooSl3E63oaYSFhUJKn0_DPOE77xd4G1Tcf22E2hJHg61u6gfCrhaHzfuwnPKZcUCMgAZoG5qlUvqFz7I0k2Yk8Dj3t_TCYP2eKD2_Sfjpc0aVAmqS3meB2fpMPVRmi8sOOt2u27dWvHEZEFv8bZLujIbV1b6ZT2HlH5heDD7_jmzKPyk3eRzduFvp9esjgv7LPPk5JgPn7AJ7042ahKMXII5L06vytPJNo1QjuNZbzqdji5_x3LkLMO7SSec_tLS872CKXhsJPCi2qCnmQdjV7CZF8ASppzCrT7zZmILUHz2PK5F7AVGQYu95SKB6R9z-qxo4QUphf9NvscSbqT6q3ql2cea7y2o8IKN9-YFreurTrvf6V9eX3YGnZvhsOd7a_jcH3Tbg-GwM-gPe1dX_Zut7_2QErx221edfvf6Ztjt9Xvdy_6gZ939bQ-Rx_Y_cvlaKQ) to help wrap your head around it.  There are a number of tests in another wpt pr, but we'll be updating that to reflect tests for each leaf in this diagram\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Apple\n   * Google\n   * Mozilla\n   * Igalia\n   \n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * ...\n   \n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=576815\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1722762\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=64861\n\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: …\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/9e9a673...3d39a57/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/9e9a673...3d39a57/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">/rendering.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9166/9e9a673...3d39a57/rendering.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 14, 2023, 2:21 PM UTC (3d39a57)\">diff</a> )",
